Subject: [PATCH 4/6] fix: journey shows "Halima Yusuf", as the other
 prototypes do

SkillLens showed the shared data's displayName "Halima Y." where
PathFinder, YoCV and Ziqi show "Halima Yusuf". With journey=demo the host
page header and the embed's sample banner (the iframe gets journey=demo)
now use her full name from the shared data (firstName + lastName).
Without journey=demo both are unchanged.

- lib/journey.ts: JOURNEY_NAME; lib/shared.ts reads firstName/lastName
- test in lib/journey.test.ts

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
